  title: IT IS TOO COLD!
  description: "It's very cold here on the mountain! \nPandas eat a lot of bamboo,
    but it grows very slowly in cold weather. This means there might not be enough
    food for the panda. \nShould the panda move somewhere else or stay on the mountain? "
  choiceA: Move
  choiceB: Stay
  choiceC: 
  titleDA: DET ER FOR KOLDT!
  descriptionDA: "Det er meget koldt her p\xE5 bjerget! \nPandaer spiser masser af
    bambus, men det vokser meget langsomt, n\xE5r det er koldt. Det betyder, at der
    m\xE5ske ikke er mad nok til pandaen. \nSkal pandaen flytte et andet sted hen
    eller blive p\xE5 bjerget?  "
  choiceADA: Flyt
  choiceBDA: Bliv
